> Does anyone know how to make a plot of mean slope x elevation like
> figures 8 and 9 of:
> Guth, P. L. , 2006. Geomorphometry from SRTM: Comparison to NED
> Photogrammetric Engineering and Remote Sensing, , 72, 269-278
>
