I'm looking for a way to interface gvSIG with R, and I was taking a
look to spgrass6 source to have inspiration.
I've a question about the readVECT6 function. Looking into the
relative R script it seems the vector layer is being exported to
shaprfile, then is read with readOGR (Rgdal package?), but the
shapefile created is never destroyed after this operation.
Am I wrong?  If not, isn't it garbage to be trashed?


